# ==============================================================================
# IMPORTANT VERSION-CONTROL RULES
# ==============================================================================
#
# KEEP TRACKED:
#
# .github/
# assets/
# docs/
# THE-GAMING-HORIZON/
#
# netlify.toml
#
# README.md
# BRAND.md
# CHANGELOG.md
# CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
# CONTRIBUTING.md
# COPYRIGHT.md
# LICENSE
# PRIVACY.md
# ROADMAP.md
# SECURITY.md
# SUPPORT.md
# TERMS.md
# THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
#
# Safe environment templates may be tracked:
#
# .env.example
# .env.local.example
# .env.production.example
#
#
# NEVER COMMIT:
#
# passwords
# API keys
# access tokens
# private keys
# private certificates
# service-role credentials
# bot tokens
# deployment credentials
# database credentials
# webhook secrets
# session secrets
# real environment files
#
# ==============================================================================
